---
import { layers as defaultLayers } from "../../data/cns5-data";

interface LayerItem {
  label: string;
  desc: string;
}

interface Props {
  layers?: LayerItem[];
}

const { layers = defaultLayers } = Astro.props;
---

<section id="integrated">
  <h2>综合诊断：四层结构</h2>
  <p>每份病理报告按以下四层自下而上合成最终诊断：</p>
  <ol class="layers">
    {layers.map((l, i) => (
      <li style={`--i:${i}`}>
        <span class="layer-label">{l.label}</span>
        <span class="layer-desc">{l.desc}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>
</section>

<section id="terminology">
  <h2>术语与标签</h2>
  <div class="two-col">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>旧术语</th><th>CNS5 新术语</th><th>示例</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>entity（实体）</td>
          <td><strong>type（类型）</strong></td>
          <td rowspan="2">脑（脊）膜瘤 = 一个 type，下辖脊索样 / 横纹肌样 / 透明细胞等多个 subtype</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>variant（变异型）</td>
          <td><strong>subtype（亚型）</strong></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <div class="callout">
      <p><strong>NOS vs NEC</strong></p>
      <p><strong>NOS</strong>（not otherwise specified）：分子检测不全，无法进一步分类。</p>
      <p><strong>NEC</strong>（not elsewhere classified）：分子特征已完全明确，但不符现有分类框架——这是 CNS5 新增的标签。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  section {
    margin: 0 0 3rem;
    scroll-margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  p {
    margin: 0.6rem 0;
  }
  .layers {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1.2rem 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .layers li {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.1rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin-left: calc(var(--i) * 1.5rem);
  }
  .layer-label {
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .layer-desc {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .two-col {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.2rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .two-col {
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    }
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
  th {
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .callout {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
  .callout p:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .callout p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
